  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>β</mi></math> are the solutions of <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>γ</mi></math> are the solutions of <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cosec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math> in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to"
  },
